    "details": "<h2>COBOT-EX 2026 &mdash; Inter-College Hackathon</h2>\n<p><strong>Build. Innovate. Compete.</strong></p>\n<p>COBOT-EX 2026 is an inter-college hackathon organized by the Crescent Club of Cobotics at B. S. Abdur Rahman Crescent Institute of Science and Technology, Chennai.</p>\n<p>The hackathon invites college students to develop innovative, technology-driven solutions and demonstrate their creativity, technical abilities, and problem-solving skills.</p>\n<h2>Event Details</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Date:</strong> 10 November 2026</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Venue:</strong> B. S. Abdur Rahman Crescent Institute of Science and Technology, Vandalur, Chennai, Tamil Nadu</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Registration deadline:</strong> 5 November 2026</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Registration fee:</strong> ₹250 per team</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Prize pool:</strong> ₹5,000</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Team size:</strong> 1&ndash;2 members</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Eligibility</h2>\n<p>Open to college students from institutions across India. Participants must register within the deadline and follow the official event instructions.</p>\n<h2>Participation Process</h2>\n<ol start=\"1\">\n<li>\n<p>Register for the COBOT-EX 2026 Hackathon.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Provide the required participant and team details.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Review the official problem statement, rules, and submission instructions provided by the organizers.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Participate on the scheduled event date and submit your solution as instructed.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Rules</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Each team may have 1&ndash;2 members.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Each team must complete its own registration.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Participants must follow the official problem statement, deadlines, and submission requirements.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Plagiarism, misrepresentation, or unauthorized use of another team's work is not permitted.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Organizers' decisions regarding evaluation and prizes will be final, subject to the published rules.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Prizes</h2>\n<p>A total prize pool of ₹5,000 is allocated to the Hackathon.</p>\n<h2>Why Participate?</h2>\n<p>Showcase your technical skills, collaborate with fellow innovators, develop practical solutions, and compete with students from other colleges.</p>",
